    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Sungaia Your Playground</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine fun platformer movement and fluid combat with rhythm elements as you storm different locations across the land of Sungaia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As newly-appointed Blade Guardian Yinyang, learn techniques that use various types of ki energy such as fire, wind and metal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An important decision you make will determine which territories and bosses you face throughout your journey to save your brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502780/extras/22c22d941b18535ebeb47779f4821c10.poster.avif?t=1740961268\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502780/extras/22c22d941b18535ebeb47779f4821c10.webm?t=1740961268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502780/extras/22c22d941b18535ebeb47779f4821c10.mp4?t=1740961268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If You Can't Beat Them, Copy Them</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the sonic powers of the Beat Blade! Parry enemy attacks then mimic them by catching the rhythms of their sonic vibrations. Use the stolen moves to fight back or discover hidden secrets in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502780/extras/5fd770717b3ea9c257313b2764e4b29c.poster.avif?t=1740961268\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502780/extras/5fd770717b3ea9c257313b2764e4b29c.webm?t=1740961268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502780/extras/5fd770717b3ea9c257313b2764e4b29c.mp4?t=1740961268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Rival Clans, One Divided Land</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Iruha Clan runs the western half of Sungaia. They are a traditional clan of blade wielders and martial artists, led by the elderly Chief Rezru, with their key territories protected by the Blade Guardians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Laruha Clan occupies East Sungaia, governed by Premier Elemi who defends the land alongside her clan\u2019s best fighters. They promote technology and equality, rejecting old-fashioned thinking and religion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502780/extras/735b8cf158e8df307d31e2df8a19b2cf.avif?t=1740961268\" width=800 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chief Rezru has two warrior grandsons - Arangei, training to be the next Chief of Iruha, and his younger brother Yinyang. When Premier Elemi offers Yinyang his kidnapped brother back in return for fighting for the Laruha Clan, Yinyang must make the hardest decision in his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502780/extras/e1bedc73fac7148f1640b5709c97bb3a.avif?t=1740961268\" data-has-big width=800 height=254 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make Sungaia Your Playground</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine fun platformer movement and fluid combat with rhythm elements as you storm different locations across the land of Sungaia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As newly-appointed Blade Guardian Yinyang, learn techniques that use various types of ki energy such as fire, wind and metal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An important decision you make will determine which territories and bosses you face throughout your journey to save your brother.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502780/extras/22c22d941b18535ebeb47779f4821c10.poster.avif?t=1740961268\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502780/extras/22c22d941b18535ebeb47779f4821c10.webm?t=1740961268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502780/extras/22c22d941b18535ebeb47779f4821c10.mp4?t=1740961268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If You Can't Beat Them, Copy Them</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness the sonic powers of the Beat Blade! Parry enemy attacks then mimic them by catching the rhythms of their sonic vibrations. Use the stolen moves to fight back or discover hidden secrets in the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502780/extras/5fd770717b3ea9c257313b2764e4b29c.poster.avif?t=1740961268\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502780/extras/5fd770717b3ea9c257313b2764e4b29c.webm?t=1740961268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502780/extras/5fd770717b3ea9c257313b2764e4b29c.mp4?t=1740961268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Two Rival Clans, One Divided Land</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Iruha Clan runs the western half of Sungaia. They are a traditional clan of blade wielders and martial artists, led by the elderly Chief Rezru, with their key territories protected by the Blade Guardians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Laruha Clan occupies East Sungaia, governed by Premier Elemi who defends the land alongside her clan\u2019s best fighters. They promote technology and equality, rejecting old-fashioned thinking and religion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502780/extras/735b8cf158e8df307d31e2df8a19b2cf.avif?t=1740961268\" width=800 height=314 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chief Rezru has two warrior grandsons - Arangei, training to be the next Chief of Iruha, and his younger brother Yinyang. When Premier Elemi offers Yinyang his kidnapped brother back in return for fighting for the Laruha Clan, Yinyang must make the hardest decision in his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502780/extras/e1bedc73fac7148f1640b5709c97bb3a.avif?t=1740961268\" data-has-big width=800 height=254 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Take the Beat Blade in hand and parry, slash and catch the beat to mimic enemies' special moves. Will you help the enemy clan in return for your kidnapped brother? Or fight back and take him by force? In this rhythm-action platformer, your choice will shape the entire adventure...",
